# Operations

### `compose.yaml`

```yaml
# Rendered for Goodfetch Collie [PRODUCT_VERSION] (ADR 0049, ADR 0122).
services:
  daemon:
    image: ghcr.io/goodfetch/collie:[PRODUCT_VERSION]@sha256:[IMAGE_DIGEST]
    command: ["daemon", "run"]
    user: "10001:10001"
    restart: unless-stopped
    stop_grace_period: 120s
    shm_size: 1g
    security_opt:
      - seccomp=./seccomp-profile.json
    ports:
      - "127.0.0.1:7600:7600"
    volumes:
      - goodfetch-home:/home/goodfetch/.goodfetch
      - ./operator-policy.toml:/home/goodfetch/.goodfetch/0.0/operator-policy.toml:ro
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "/usr/local/bin/goodfetch-collie", "daemon", "health"]
      interval: 15s
      timeout: 5s
      retries: 3
      start_period: 30s
    logging:
      driver: local

volumes:
  goodfetch-home:
# template-marker-change
```

### `operator-policy.toml`

```toml
# Managed Operator policy for Goodfetch Collie [PRODUCT_VERSION] (ADR 0049, ADR 0083).
# Mounted read-only into the container by compose.yaml.
version = "0.1"

[settings.daemon]
address = "0.0.0.0:7600"

[settings.daemon.tls]
upstream = true

[settings.ops]
address = "127.0.0.1:9464"
```
